{"title":"2025 CSMC Problems/Part A Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Wenfei has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/a/e0a0db32027a732ac57d37ef2ae9bb150f65b108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> cookies at the end of Monday. On each of the next four days (Tuesday through Friday), Wenfei eats <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> cookies at lunch and then after school he buys enough cookies to double the total number of cookies he has. How many cookies does Wenfei have after buying cookies on Friday?\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>After eating <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> of the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/a/e0a0db32027a732ac57d37ef2ae9bb150f65b108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> cookies, Wenfei has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/f/a/1fa17d01e2fa6f7b7b6ce4af99c9cd1c005823e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7 - 2 = 5$\" width=\"73\" height=\"12\" /> cookies. Therefore, he has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/a/6/6a6e5f37861d1d64b0a6afdd09ab2fad7644680a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5 \\times 2 = 10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"85\" height=\"15\" /> cookies at the end of Tuesday.\n</p><p>After eating <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> of the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc606f7f1e530731ab4f1cc364c01dc64a4455ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> cookies, Wenfei has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/3/2/2326a4ec693fc25d97ef7a8a229b1c63f324a0a9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10 - 2 = 8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"85\" height=\"15\" /> cookies. Therefore, he has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/4/6/d462bb87c4d426f8ad25ea45066078a3fb0e6e9b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8 \\times 2 = 16$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"82\" height=\"13\" /> cookies at the end of Wednesday.\n</p><p>After eating <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> of the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/5/9a5b4928c8fe50ce3c2428da3bee3505e891b788.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$16$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> cookies, Wenfei has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/e/6eeffe4a6d0fb8960de538692b6c7d385d6348d9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$16 - 2 = 14$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"94\" height=\"15\" /> cookies. Therefore, he has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/6/9/069f76938e2fc2a392f34822b3e87e77c508d815.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$14 \\times 2 = 28$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"94\" height=\"15\" /> cookies at the end of Thursday.\n</p><p>After eating <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> of the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/2/6/9265f5dd6dade78136a6be158ace46bf7c0f8ce3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$28$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> cookies, Wenfei has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/1/a/c1a91c2116f4a0920564f882282600d8d2b2659b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$28 - 2 = 26$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"94\" height=\"15\" /> cookies. Therefore, he has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/c/4/3c49270dd2622498f183b38644e8c960e61463f1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$26 \\times 2 = \\boxed{52}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"105\" height=\"25\" /> cookies at the end of Friday.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CSMC\" title=\"2025 CSMC\">2025 CSMC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CSMC_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2025 CSMC Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CSMC_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2025 CSMC Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b>First Problem</b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_2\" title=\"2025 CSMC Problems/Part A Problem 2\">Part A Problem 2</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Part A 1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_2\" title=\"2025 CSMC Problems/Part A Problem 2\">Part A 2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_3\" title=\"2025 CSMC Problems/Part A Problem 3\">Part A 3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_4\" title=\"2025 CSMC Problems/Part A Problem 4\">Part A 4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2025 CSMC Problems/Part A Problem 5 (page does not exist)\">Part A 5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2025 CSMC Problems/Part A Problem 6 (page does not exist)\">Part A 6</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CSMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_1\" title=\"2025 CSMC Problems/Part B Problem 1\">Part B 1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CSMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2025 CSMC Problems/Part B Problem 2 (page does not exist)\">Part B 2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CSMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2025 CSMC Problems/Part B Problem 3 (page does not exist)\">Part B 3</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=CEMC_Senior_Competition\" title=\"CEMC Senior Competition\">CEMC Senior Competition</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018070401\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.021 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.039 seconds\nPreprocessor